#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:9
msgid "Coupled Solvers"
msgstr "耦合求解器"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:13
msgid ""
"Coupled solvers are experimental and exposed through "
":mod:`isaaclab_contrib.coupling`. Their API, behavior, feature support, "
"performance, and implementation may change."
msgstr ""
"耦合求解器是实验性功能，通过 :mod:`isaaclab_contrib.coupling` 提供。其 API、行为、功能支持、性能和实现均可能变化。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:17
msgid ""
"Newton can partition one model between multiple solvers and exchange state "
"and forces between them during each simulation step. This lets a task "
"combine solver families that target different physics, such as an MJWarp "
"rigid robot interacting with VBD cloth or an MPM material."
msgstr ""
"Newton 可以将一个模型分配给多个求解器，并在每个仿真步中交换状态和力。这样，任务就能组合处理不同物理现象的求解器，例如让 MJWarp "
"刚性机器人与 VBD 布料或 MPM 材料交互。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:22
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab exposes this framework through :mod:`isaaclab_contrib.coupling`. "
"The adapter turns configuration selectors into named Newton solver entries, "
"constructs the selected coupling algorithm, and integrates it with "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg`. For the shared-model "
"architecture, iteration algorithms, supported constraint rows, and solver-"
"specific implementation details, see Newton's `Coupled Solvers concept page "
"<https://newton-physics.github.io/newton/stable/concepts/coupling.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 通过 :mod:`isaaclab_contrib.coupling` 暴露这一框架。适配层将配置选择器转换为具名的 Newton "
"求解器条目，构建选定的耦合算法，并将其集成到 :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` "
"。共享模型架构、迭代算法、受支持的约束行和求解器专用实现细节，见 Newton 的 `耦合求解器概念页面 <https://newton-"
"physics.github.io/newton/stable/concepts/coupling.html>`_ 。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:33
msgid "The coupling model"
msgstr "耦合模型"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:35
msgid ""
"A coupled simulation starts from one Newton model. Instead of giving the "
"whole model to one solver, Isaac Lab partitions it into named entries. Each "
"entry selects a solver and owns a disjoint part of the model."
msgstr ""
"耦合仿真从一个 Newton 模型开始。Isaac Lab "
"不将整个模型交给单个求解器，而是将其划分为多个具名条目。每个条目选择一个求解器，并持有模型中彼此不重叠的一部分。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:39
msgid ""
"The animation below shows how source-owned gripper bodies interact with "
"material owned by a destination solver through local proxies:"
msgstr "下方动画展示了源求解器持有的夹爪刚体如何通过局部代理，与目标求解器持有的材料交互："

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:64
msgid ""
"Each solver receives a view of the shared model. Only the elements owned by "
"its entry are reconciled into the final shared state. An element can belong "
"to at most one entry; unassigned elements remain outside the nested solvers."
" Keep each articulation in a single entry."
msgstr ""
"每个求解器获得共享模型的一个视图，只有其条目持有的元素会汇总到最终共享状态中。每个元素最多属于一个条目；未分配的元素不参与嵌套求解器。一个关节体应完整地放在同一个条目中。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:69
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab resolves ownership selectors, constructs the Newton entry views, "
"and runs the coupled solver through the normal Newton backend lifecycle. "
"Newton owns the coupling algorithms and the exchange of poses, forces, and "
"constraint information between entries."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 解析所有权选择器、构建 Newton 条目视图，并通过正常的 Newton 后端生命周期运行耦合求解器。Newton "
"负责耦合算法，以及条目之间的位姿、力和约束信息交换。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:76
msgid "Choose Proxy or ADMM Coupling"
msgstr "选择代理耦合或 ADMM 耦合"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:82
msgid "Approach"
msgstr "方法"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:83
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "它是如何工作的"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:84
msgid "When to use it"
msgstr "适用情况"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:85
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "代理耦合"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:86
msgid ""
"A source-owned body or particle appears as a virtual endpoint in a "
"destination solver. The destination returns feedback on a later pass or "
"iteration."
msgstr "源条目持有的刚体或粒子作为虚拟端点出现在目标求解器中；目标求解器在后续轮次或迭代中返回反馈。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:89
msgid ""
"Use when the interaction is naturally directional, such as a rigid collider "
"inside a deformable or particle solve. Proxy coupling can reuse the "
"destination solver's contact path and is the established path for Isaac "
"Lab's coupled MJWarp--VBD and rigid--MPM tasks."
msgstr ""
"适用于交互具有自然方向性的情况，例如可变形体或粒子求解中的刚性碰撞体。代理耦合能够复用目标求解器的接触处理路径，是 Isaac Lab 中耦合 "
"MJWarp–VBD 和刚体–MPM 任务的既有实现方式。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:93
msgid "ADMM"
msgstr "ADMM"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:94
msgid ""
"The coupler creates interface constraints between entries, iterates the sub-"
"solvers, and applies equal and opposite interface forces."
msgstr "耦合器在条目之间创建界面约束，迭代各子求解器，并施加大小相等、方向相反的界面力。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:96
msgid ""
"Use when the interface should be symmetric, especially for supported cross-"
"entry joints, body--particle attachments, or frictional contacts. ADMM has "
"more tuning parameters and supports a narrower set of constraint rows."
msgstr "适用于界面应当对称的情况，尤其是受支持的跨条目关节、刚体–粒子附着或摩擦接触。ADMM 调参项较多，支持的约束行范围也更窄。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:101
msgid ""
"Proxy coupling is usually the simpler starting point for collider-style "
"rigid--deformable interaction. Use ``mode=\"lagged\"`` first; the "
"``\"staggered\"`` mode uses a newer source state but is more sensitive to "
"the timestep and ordering. Increase coupling iterations only after each "
"entry is stable on its own."
msgstr ""
"对于基于碰撞体的刚体–可变形体交互，代理耦合通常是更简单的入门选择。先使用 ``mode=\"lagged\"`` ； "
"``\"staggered\"`` 模式使用更新的源状态，但对时间步长和执行顺序更敏感。只有各条目独立运行时已经稳定，才应增加耦合迭代次数。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:107
msgid ""
"ADMM is a better fit when assigning a source and destination would make the "
"physical interface artificially one-way. Its fixed iteration count and "
"penalty, proximal, and stabilization parameters are part of the coupled "
"constraint solve, so tune them together with the timestep and the "
"participating solvers. Newton's concept page is the source of truth for the "
"currently supported joints, contacts, and limitations."
msgstr ""
"如果人为区分源与目标会将物理界面变成单向交互，ADMM "
"更适合。固定迭代次数、罚参数、近端项和稳定化参数共同参与耦合约束求解，应结合时间步长和参与求解器一起调节。当前支持的关节、接触及限制，以 Newton "
"概念页面为准。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:114
msgid ""
"Proxy coupling can have lower coupling overhead because it reuses the "
"destination solver's contact path and may work with one pass, but its "
"directional exchange is timestep- and ordering-sensitive. ADMM represents a "
"symmetric interface, but every coupling iteration advances the participating"
" solvers again. Additional passes or iterations can improve coupled response"
" and interface convergence at a higher runtime cost. Neither approach is "
"uniformly more accurate; compare them on task-relevant physical metrics."
msgstr ""
"代理耦合复用目标求解器的接触路径，有时只需一轮，因此耦合开销可能较低，但有方向的数据交换对时间步长和顺序敏感。ADMM "
"表示对称界面，但每次耦合迭代都会再次推进参与求解器。增加轮次或迭代可以改善耦合响应和界面收敛，也会增加运行时间。两种方法都不总是更准确，应通过与任务相关的物理指标比较。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:124
msgid "Configure a coupled solver"
msgstr "配置耦合求解器"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:126
msgid ""
"In Isaac Lab, :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerEntryCfg` defines "
"each entry's solver and ownership. Use "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerProxyCfg` or "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerAdmmCfg` as the "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` solver configuration."
msgstr ""
"在 Isaac Lab 中， :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerEntryCfg` "
"定义各条目的求解器与所有权。将 :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerProxyCfg` 或 "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerAdmmCfg` 用作 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` 的求解器配置。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:132
msgid ""
"The following configuration mirrors the maintained Franka rigid--deformable "
"tasks. It assigns the complete robot to MJWarp, particles and static "
"collision geometry to VBD, and exposes only the hand and fingers as VBD "
"proxy colliders:"
msgstr ""
"以下配置与维护中的 Franka 刚体–可变形体任务一致：完整机器人交给 MJWarp，粒子和静态碰撞几何交给 VBD，仅将手掌和手指作为 VBD "
"的代理碰撞体："

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:178
msgid ""
"For ADMM, keep the ownership entries and replace the proxy mapping with the "
"symmetric interfaces that should be coupled:"
msgstr "对于 ADMM，保留所有权条目，将代理映射替换为需要耦合的对称界面："

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:195
msgid ""
"Set ``contact_pairs=None`` to generate every distinct entry pair, or use an "
"empty list to disable ADMM contact coupling while retaining supported cross-"
"entry joints and attachments."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``contact_pairs=None`` 可为每对不同条目生成接触；使用空列表则禁用 ADMM "
"接触耦合，同时保留受支持的跨条目关节和附着约束。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:201
msgid "Tune Coupling"
msgstr "调节耦合参数"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:203
msgid "Stabilize each entry independently before changing coupling controls."
msgstr "修改耦合参数前，先保证各条目独立运行时稳定。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:205
msgid ""
"``CouplerEntryCfg.substeps`` changes the time resolution for one entry; more"
" substeps add solver work."
msgstr "``CouplerEntryCfg.substeps`` 改变单个条目的时间分辨率；更多子步会增加求解器工作量。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:207
msgid ""
"For proxy coupling, ``mode`` controls exchange ordering, ``iterations`` "
"controls relaxation passes, ``mass_scale`` changes proxy effective inertia "
"in the destination, and ``collide_interval`` controls contact refresh "
"frequency."
msgstr ""
"对于代理耦合， ``mode`` 控制交换顺序， ``iterations`` 控制松弛轮次， ``mass_scale`` "
"改变代理在目标求解器中的有效惯性， ``collide_interval`` 控制接触刷新频率。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:210
msgid ""
"For ADMM, ``iterations`` controls interface passes, ``rho`` sets the penalty"
" weight, ``gamma`` adds proximal inertia and velocity weighting, and "
"``baumgarte`` adds positional-error correction."
msgstr ""
"对于 ADMM， ``iterations`` 控制界面迭代轮次， ``rho`` 设置罚项权重， ``gamma`` 添加近端惯性与速度权重， "
"``baumgarte`` 添加位置误差修正。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:214
msgid ""
"More substeps or iterations can improve stability or convergence, but cost "
"runtime and cannot repair an unstable entry. The generated :doc:`coupling "
"configuration API </source/api/lab_contrib/isaaclab_contrib.coupling>` lists"
" every field and default; Newton's concept page explains the underlying "
"algorithms."
msgstr ""
"更多子步或迭代可能改善稳定性或收敛，但会增加运行时间，也不能修复本身不稳定的条目。生成的 :doc:`耦合配置 API "
"</source/api/lab_contrib/isaaclab_contrib.coupling>` 列出所有字段和默认值，Newton "
"概念页面解释底层算法。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:222
msgid "ADMM Contact Capacity"
msgstr "ADMM 接触容量"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:224
msgid ""
"ADMM's internal contact buffers are independent of "
"``NewtonCfg.collision_cfg``. Increase "
"``CouplerAdmmCfg.contact_max_triangle_pairs`` for triangle-pair overflows, "
"or ``contact_reduction_hashtable_size_factor`` for contact-reduction hash "
"table warnings. Both default to ``None`` (Newton's defaults); explicit "
"values require support in Newton's ``SolverCoupledADMM.Config``. Capacities "
"cover all environments in one process, independently on each rank in multi-"
"GPU jobs."
msgstr ""
"ADMM 的内部接触缓冲区独立于 ``NewtonCfg.collision_cfg`` 。三角形对溢出时，增大 "
"``CouplerAdmmCfg.contact_max_triangle_pairs`` ；出现接触约简哈希表警告时，增大 "
"``contact_reduction_hashtable_size_factor`` 。两者默认均为 ``None`` ，使用 Newton "
"默认值；显式赋值要求 Newton 的 ``SolverCoupledADMM.Config`` 支持相应参数。容量覆盖一个进程中的全部环境，在多 "
"GPU 任务中，各 rank 独立计算。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:231
msgid ""
"With ``rigid_contact_matching=\"latest\"`` or ``\"sticky\"``, triangle-pair "
"capacity must be less than ``2**20``; larger values require "
"``\"disabled\"``. The hash table can grow independently while retaining "
"matching:"
msgstr ""
"当 ``rigid_contact_matching=\"latest\"`` 或 ``\"sticky\"`` 时，三角形对容量必须小于 "
"``2**20`` ；更大的值要求使用 ``\"disabled\"`` 。保留匹配功能时，可以单独增大哈希表："

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:246
msgid "Rigid--MPM Comparison Recordings"
msgstr "刚体–MPM 对比视频"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:248
msgid ""
"For proxy coupling, ``mass_scale`` changes a source body's effective mass "
"and inertia in the destination view; it does not change the authored rigid-"
"body mass. Start at ``1`` and increase it only when the rigid solver "
"strongly constrains the body during MPM contact. Check both supported and "
"freely moving cases, since a large scale can suppress legitimate motion."
msgstr ""
"在代理耦合中， ``mass_scale`` 改变源刚体在目标视图中的有效质量和惯性，不改变写入模型的刚体质量。先使用 ``1`` ，仅在 MPM "
"接触过程中刚体求解器对刚体施加强约束时增加该值。支撑状态和自由运动状态都应检查，因为较大的缩放可能抑制正常运动。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:254
msgid ""
"The G1 recordings show one policy walking across sand, snow, and clay. The "
"one-way recording uses lower-leg proxies, while the two-way recording uses "
"full-body proxies. They are presentation examples, **not** a controlled "
"single-variable comparison; keep the policy, seed, commands, and proxy "
"geometry identical when measuring a coupling effect."
msgstr ""
"G1 视频展示同一策略在沙、雪和黏土上行走。单向视频使用小腿代理，双向视频使用全身代理。它们是展示示例， **并非** "
"控制单一变量的比较；测量耦合效果时，应保持策略、随机种子、命令和代理几何一致。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:263
msgid "One-way, lower-leg proxies"
msgstr "单向，小腿代理"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:271
msgid "Two-way, full-body proxies"
msgstr "双向，全身代理"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:281
msgid "Start from a maintained task"
msgstr "从维护中的任务开始"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:283
msgid ""
"The :ref:`newton-vbd-proxy-coupling` guide contains the complete "
"configuration and runnable commands for the Franka soft-body tasks. Start "
"from that example when building a proxy-coupled rigid--deformable "
"environment, then narrow entry ownership and proxy selectors to the bodies "
"that participate in the interaction."
msgstr ""
":ref:`newton-vbd-proxy-coupling` 指南提供 Franka "
"软体任务的完整配置和可运行命令。构建代理耦合的刚体–可变形体环境时，可从该示例开始，再将条目所有权和代理选择器缩小到实际参与交互的刚体。"

#: source/concepts/coupled_solvers.rst:289
msgid ""
"Current Isaac Lab limitations include no support for nested couplers or "
"Newton contact sensors, and proxy coupling supports at most two entries. "
"Some solver modes require manager-specific lifecycle work and cannot be "
"nested in a coupler. Validate each entry independently before tuning the "
"coupled result, and consult the Newton concept page for current algorithm-"
"level support and limitations."
msgstr ""
"目前 Isaac Lab 不支持嵌套耦合器和 Newton "
"接触传感器，代理耦合最多支持两个条目。部分求解器模式需要管理器专用的生命周期操作，不能嵌套在耦合器中。调节耦合结果前，先分别验证各条目；当前算法级支持与限制见"
" Newton 概念页面。"
